{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2607062210-net-babiniku-giemon-humanoid-embodiment-procurement"
  :title "ADR-2607062210: net-babiniku characters -- optional physical embodiment via
          kotoba-lang/giemon, procurable through an EMS ordering pipeline"
  :status "proposed"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "net-babiniku-giemon-embodiment"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-07-06"
  :authoritative_for
  ["a net-babiniku persona may declare an associated physical Giemon body -- this ADR wires
    existing Giemon products to character identities, it does not design a new robot"
   "only Giemon Otete (6-DOF arm + crawler, shipping, real BOM) is orderable under this ADR --
    Hitogata (17-axis biped) remains :in-design with no articulation fixture and is NOT
    presented as purchasable, per the honest-default principle"
   "any path from a persona's proposed behavior to a physical Giemon body's joint commands
    must pass through kotoba-lang/robotics' safety gate exactly as kotoba.giemon.governor
    already requires for Giemon Kaigo -- no LLM-to-actuator shortcut"
   "ordering/procurement reuses the yoro-supply Pregel-cell actor shape and cloud-itonami's
    plm.cljc BOM primitives rather than building a new EC/ordering stack"
   "the robot purchase-order payment rail is a distinct, ordinary fiat rail from
    ADR-2607062200's adult-content-gated chat-monetization rail -- must not be conflated"]
  :related
  ["90-docs/adr/2607062200-net-babiniku-onlyfans-style-creator-monetization.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607011000-cloud-itonami-robotics-premise-and-isic-21-21.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607020000-kotoba-lang-giemon-product-line.md"
   "orgs/gftdcojp/ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp/90-docs/adr/2604252100-robotics-product-manufacturing-package.md.edn"]
  :supersedes []
  :superseded_by []}

 :problem
 {:source "user direction 2026-07-06: design a humanoid robot per net-babiniku character based
           on kotoba-lang/giemon, and make it orderable (発注できるように)"
  :prior_art
  {:giemon
   {:what "kotoba-lang/giemon (ADR-2605142200): open-hardware robot product line in pure
           Clojure -- product metadata, forward kinematics/torque validation, actuator BOM
           generator, viewer scene-IR, CSV/JSON export"
    :products
    {:otete ":product/status :shipping, 6-DOF arm + crawler, real articulation fixture
             (fixtures/giemon_arm6/, EDN source of truth + URDF parity oracle)"
     :hitogata ":in-design, 17-axis biped, NO articulation fixture yet"
     :caterpillar ":in-design, dual-track UGV"
     :giemon_kaigo "ADR-2605142300, in-home elder-care application consuming these products --
                    a distinct use case from what's asked here"}
    :governance_delegation "giemon does NOT own safety governance -- delegates to
                            kotoba-lang/robotics (ADR-2607011000); kotoba.giemon.governor is a
                            thin wrapper over it, per giemon's own README"}
   :kotoba_robotics
   {:what "orgs/kotoba-lang/robotics/src/kotoba/robotics.cljc -- the one safety contract
           every cloud-itonami actuation path (26 industry blueprints) depends on"
    :doctrine "'policy, not control. It does not drive motors; it gives a governor the
               records it needs to refuse unsafe actuation before it ever reaches hardware.'"
    :safety_classes "#{:none :low :medium :high :safety-critical}"
    :human_sign_off_classes "#{:high :safety-critical} -- require interrupt-before human
                             sign-off"
    :action_kinds "#{:sense :move :grasp :actuate :emit} -- only :sense is read-only"}
   :manufacturing_package_adr
   {:what "ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp/90-docs/adr/2604252100 (Accepted): real-machine control
           adapter boundary + manufacturing package definition for physical robot products"
    :control_boundary "AI agent は actuator に直接 command を送ってはならない -- mission
                       plan/replan/approval/simulation only; real dispatch goes through a
                       safety gateway then an asset-specific adapter (ROS2/MAVLink/VDA5050)"
    :manufacturing_package "CAD/ECAD/CAM/BOM/routing/inspection/firmware/calibration bundled
                            together -- no single-file standard exists for real hardware"}
   :procurement_actors
   {:yoro_supply "app-aozora/20-actors/yoro-supply (ADR-2605250850): building-materials
                  procurement actor, 5 Pregel cells (supplier_selection/order_placement/
                  manufacture_track/shipment/delivery_verify), lexicon-typed PO/RFQ events,
                  14 Constitutional Gates, input = projectBOM"
    :cloud_itonami "itonami/store.cljc (procurement line-items, UNSPSC/supplier/qty/cost),
                    itonami/governor.cljc (HARD-holds unregistered-supplier lineage breaks),
                    cloud_itonami/plm.cljc (item/bom-edge/change-order/make-buy/unit-cost/
                    mbom-rows via kotoba.plm.item)"
    :conclusion "no general-purpose EC/ordering stack exists or should be built -- the
                actor-based procurement shape is the established pattern for 'turn a BOM into
                a real purchase order'"}}}

 :decision
 {:embodiment_scope
  {:what "physical embodiment is optional and per-character, not a new robot design -- a
          net-babiniku persona may declare an associated Giemon body; this ADR wires existing
          (or eventually-existing) Giemon products to character identities"}
  :mvp_orderable_body
  {:what "Giemon Otete (6-DOF arm + crawler) only, NOT Hitogata"
   :why "Hitogata is :in-design with no articulation fixture -- no real BOM exists to order.
         Per the honest-default principle from ADR-2607062200 (no vaporware presented as
         purchasable), Hitogata is not orderable under this ADR. Otete is real, shipping, and
         has a canonical BOM (fixtures/giemon_arm6/) -- that is what 発注できるように can
         actually mean today."
   :future "when Hitogata's own design work (tracked independently under
            giemon/ADR-2605142200) reaches a real fixture and BOM, it becomes eligible for
            the same ordering path with no changes to this ADR's decisions -- this ADR does
            not pull that design work forward"}
  :no_actuation_shortcut
  {:what "the persona/governor from ADR-2607062200 proposes character behavior only
          (dialogue/emotion/motion-cue) for the VIRTUAL VRM body. Any path from a character's
          behavior to a PHYSICAL Giemon body's joint commands must pass through
          kotoba.robotics' gate exactly as kotoba.giemon.governor already requires for Kaigo
          -- no exception to :high/:safety-critical human sign-off, :actuate/:move/:grasp/
          :emit are never dispatched directly from a persona proposal"}
  :ordering_pipeline
  {:reuse "yoro-supply's Pregel-cell shape (supplier_selection -> order_placement ->
           manufacture_track -> shipment -> delivery_verify) and cloud-itonami's plm.cljc
           primitives, rather than a new ordering stack"
   :mechanism "a per-character Otete BOM (arm/bom giemon-arm6 <realization-variant>) becomes
              the projectBOM input to that flow, packaged per ADR-2604252100's
              manufacturing-package manifest (BOM CSV via kotoba.giemon.export, plus
              STEP/3MF/Gerber/inspection-plan as applicable) as the artifact an EMS actually
              RFQs against"}
  :payment_rail
  {:what "ordinary physical-goods fiat transaction, no adult-content PSP constraint -- can
          use the org's existing Stripe-shaped billing schema (kotoba-lang/com-stripe,
          net-kotobase/billing.cljc pattern) for the purchase-order payment leg"
   :must_stay_distinct_from "ADR-2607062200's adult-content-gated chat-monetization rail --
                            one is adult-content-gated recurring billing, the other is a
                            one-time hardware PO; must not be conflated"}
  :character_body_binding
  {:what "which Giemon SKU (today: only Otete) a persona 'owns' as its physical embodiment is
          a persona-record data field -- cosmetic/identity binding, not a new hardware variant
          per character"}}

 :consequences
 {:only_otete_orderable "only Otete is actually orderable at this ADR's acceptance; a
                         per-character Hitogata biped remains aspirational until giemon's own
                         design track ships a real fixture/BOM"
  :scale_is_followup "the procurement pipeline's durability at scale (a real contracted EMS
                      relationship, live supplier onboarding, real shipment tracking) is a
                      business/operations follow-up, not built by this ADR"
  :new_cross_repo_deps "net-babiniku now depends on kotoba-lang/giemon and kotoba-lang/robotics
                        for anything touching a physical body -- real cross-repo dependencies,
                        not aspirational references"
  :open_followup "registering a net-babiniku-specific procurement actor (vs. reusing/forking
                 yoro-supply's cells directly) is an implementation decision left open"}

 :alternatives
 [{:option "design an all-new bespoke humanoid robot for net-babiniku instead of reusing
            giemon"
   :rejected_because "giemon is the existing open-hardware product line with real
                      BOM/kinematics/governor/manufacturing-package precedent; a bespoke
                      design duplicates real engineering work for no benefit, the same
                      reasoning ADR-2607051800 already used to reject reimplementing VRM
                      rendering glue"}
  {:option "let the persona governor command giemon joints directly, skipping kotoba.robotics'
            gate"
   :rejected_because "violates the repo's non-negotiable 'AI agent never commands actuators
                      directly' doctrine (kotoba.robotics docstring, itonami.governor's
                      no-actuation invariant, ADR-2604252100's safety-gateway requirement)"}
  {:option "build a bespoke EC/ordering system for robot purchases"
   :rejected_because "yoro-supply's Pregel-cell procurement actor and cloud-itonami/plm.cljc
                      already implement this shape; reuse over reinvention"}
  {:option "default to Hitogata (biped) as the flagship orderable body since it reads as more
            'humanoid'/VTuber-appropriate"
   :rejected_because "Hitogata is still :in-design per giemon's own README, with no real BOM;
                      presenting it as orderable would violate the honest-default principle
                      applied in ADR-2607062200"}]}
